      "answer": "a. The mean is $\\mu=(6+4+3+7+5)/5=5$. The ordered data are $3,4,5,6,7$, so the median is 5.\n\nb. It is a **population mean** because all five senior partners in the group are included.\n\nc. $\\sum(x_i-\\mu)=(6-5)+(4-5)+(3-5)+(7-5)+(5-5)=1-1-2+2+0=0$.",
